  "title": "Sweet, Salty, Spicy Party Nuts",
  "description": "This spiced nuts recipe is made with walnuts, pecans, almonds, and cashews coated in a spicy sugar syrup, then oven-roasted until crunchy and toasted.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-11-16T12:23:51-05:00",
